  "id": "USN-9205-1",
  "summary": "tiff vulnerabilities",
  "details": "Ariel Sch\u00f6n discovered that LibTIFF did not correctly handle parsing\ncertain PixarLog-compressed images. If a user or automated system were\ntricked into opening a specially crafted file, an attacker could possibly\nuse this issue to cause a denial of service or execute arbitrary code.\n(CVE-2026-12912)\n\nQuang Luong discovered that LibTIFF did not correctly handle parsing\ncertain TIFF files. If a user or automated system were tricked into\nopening a specially crafted file, an attacker could possibly use this\nissue to cause a denial of service or execute arbitrary code.\n(CVE-2026-4775)",
